	Write a Dockerfile that:
	Uses ubuntu:24.04 as base
	Sets WORKDIR to /app
	Copies the script
	Makes it executable
	Sets default ENV values for GREETING and NAME
	Runs the script
	Build as greeter:2.0.0
	Run it with default values
	Run it with custom values: -e GREETING=Welcome -e NAME=Docker
	Push it to the GitHub Container Registry
	Remove your local image
	Pull the image from the GHCR.

